  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/mod/2020/361/13329231_l.webp\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\">首领音乐模组</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">这是一款专注于在玩家与凋灵和末影龙进行激烈战斗时播放背景音乐的音乐模组。实话实说，功能就这些。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>你可以通过游戏内菜单的“选项”&gt;“音乐与音效”中的“留声机/音符盒”滑块来调整该模组音乐的音量。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800080\"><strong>你还可以运行两条不同的命令来切换（开启/关闭）模组的首领主题曲。</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#936\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#936\"><em><strong>/trigger bmm.wither_theme.toggle </strong></em>切换凋灵首领主题曲</span></span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#936\"><em><strong>/trigger bmm.ender_dragon_theme.toggle </strong></em>切换末影龙首领主题曲</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">音乐</span><br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ZdAuyYBVC4\" rel=\"nofollow\">84tangelo - The Wither (凋灵主题曲)</a></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0ZdAuyYBVC4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GAW5tuC83mE\" rel=\"nofollow\">solunary - The \"End\" At Hand (末影龙主题曲)</a></span></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GAW5tuC83mE?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如何解决“出生点播放音乐”的问题</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>你可能安装了<strong>Dynamic Surroundings（动态环境）</strong>模组。别担心，你不必完全从模组列表中移除它。相反，你可以按照以下步骤解决问题，<strong>同时保留 Dynamic Surroundings 模组。</strong><em>祝好运！</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T0fpHUYm9zE_luBFx0mNjUFQxZxxc6drXSR_lBbBJCc/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T0fpHUYm9zE_luBFx0mNjUFQxZxxc6drXSR_lBbBJCc/edit?usp=sharing</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
